{% schema %}
  {
    
    "name": "Section 1",
    "tag": "section",
    "class": "gps-632361451612406421 gps gpsil",
    "settings": [{"type":"paragraph","content":"Section design by GemPages. [Click here to start design](https://admin.shopify.com/store/photobrickusa/apps/gempages-cro/app/shopify/edit?pageType=GP_ARTICLE&editorId=632361451545166485&sectionId=632361451612406421)"},{"type":"select","label":"Section Preload","id":"section_preload","options":[{"label":"On","value":"true"},{"label":"Off","value":"false"},{"label":"Off Lazy Script","value":"off_lazy_script"}],"default":"false"},{"type":"text","label":"Checksum","id":"checksum"},{"type":"html","id":"ggjXGifa5qV_text","label":"ggjXGifa5qV_text","default":"Give More Than a Gift: Personalized Christmas Memories to Build Together"},{"type":"html","id":"gg1Tn4MpcQm_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"gg1Tn4MpcQm_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0375/0107/5595/files/7011f00a-5e62-4b80-9db8-f15ef6927232.png"},{"type":"html","id":"gg1Tn4MpcQm_alt","label":"gg1Tn4MpcQm_alt","default":"Christmas Memobrick Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"gg1Tn4MpcQm_title","label":"gg1Tn4MpcQm_title","default":"Christmas Memobrick Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"ggICevSNy-j_text","label":"ggICevSNy-j_text","default":"<p>Christmas brings people together in a way few other times of the year can. Families gather around the table, friends reconnect, and loved ones make time for traditions they look forward to every year. This Christmas, make those moments even more meaningful with a gift that invites everyone to be part of the experience.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Some Christmas gifts are exciting when the wrapping paper comes off, but the excitement can quickly fade.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A personalized gift can be different because it carries a story and reminds someone of the people and moments they treasure.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Memobrick takes that idea one step further by turning a favorite photograph into a brick mosaic that can be built together. Instead of simply handing someone a finished present, you can spend time creating it as a family, making the gift itself part of your Christmas memories.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggpxC7hmeL3_text","label":"ggpxC7hmeL3_text","default":"<p><strong>Build, Laugh, and Make Memories Together</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggB2KLKBomw_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggB2KLKBomw_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0375/0107/5595/files/f640071d-733c-4adf-870f-d226927f7b00.png"},{"type":"html","id":"ggB2KLKBomw_alt","label":"ggB2KLKBomw_alt","default":"Memobrick Christmas Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"ggB2KLKBomw_title","label":"ggB2KLKBomw_title","default":"Memobrick Christmas Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"ggCA4YgjfTe_text","label":"ggCA4YgjfTe_text","default":"<p>Building a Memobrick can turn an ordinary afternoon into a fun Christmas activity. Gather around the table, spread out the bricks, choose your roles, and watch the image slowly come together.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Children can help find and place pieces, parents can work alongside them, and grandparents can join in while sharing stories about the photograph. Every piece brings the image closer to completion, while every conversation creates another memory to remember.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>By the time the final brick is placed, your family has created more than a personalized mosaic. You have created another moment together.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggOQDMpqdah_text","label":"ggOQDMpqdah_text","default":"<p><strong>A Christmas Activity for the Whole Family</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggbM2iqZDLT_text","label":"ggbM2iqZDLT_text","default":"<p>The holidays are filled with activities, but some of the best memories come from simple things everyone can enjoy.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A Memobrick building session can become a relaxing activity after Christmas dinner, a weekend project during the holiday break, or a fun surprise for the whole family.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>It can also become a tradition. Choose a special family photograph each Christmas and build it together. Over the years, you could create a collection of mosaics that represents different chapters of your family's life.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Christmas creates countless moments worth remembering. Maybe it is the excitement on a child's face when they see the Christmas tree for the first time. Maybe it is a family gathering where everyone finally gets together. It could even be a funny photograph taken during a holiday celebration.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Instead of letting those moments remain hidden in your phone's camera roll, choose a favorite photograph and turn it into a personalized Memobrick. The finished mosaic gives that memory a special place in your home where you can continue enjoying it long after the holiday season.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggpWw2YAE48_text","label":"ggpWw2YAE48_text","default":"<p><strong>Why Building Together Makes the Gift More Special</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg-gevXVUP5_text","label":"gg-gevXVUP5_text","default":"<p>One of the best things about a personalized photo gift is that it can bring different generations together.</p><p>Parents can create a family keepsake with their children. Grandparents can preserve a photo of their grandchildren. Couples can celebrate a favorite Christmas memory. Siblings can turn a funny family moment into something they can enjoy for years.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Memobrick is not limited to one type of recipient or one kind of Christmas tradition. The right photograph can make it meaningful for almost anyone on your gift list.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggUD9UNSEoi_text","label":"ggUD9UNSEoi_text","default":"<p><strong>Choosing a Photo Everyone Will Love</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggkMoL7zB_k_text","label":"ggkMoL7zB_k_text","default":"<p>The best photo is one that immediately brings back a special memory. Consider choosing a family portrait, a Christmas gathering, a vacation photo, or a candid moment that always makes everyone smile.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For the best results, choose a clear image with good lighting and recognizable faces. Smaller sizes are best suited for close up photos with fewer subjects, while larger sizes provide more room for group photos and additional details.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gguHtYxoH0l_text","label":"gguHtYxoH0l_text","default":"<strong>OUR BEST SELLER</strong>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggK4vxH3Ue3_label","label":"ggK4vxH3Ue3_label","default":"Add to cart"},{"type":"html","id":"ggK4vxH3Ue3_outOfStockLabel","label":"ggK4vxH3Ue3_outOfStockLabel","default":"Out Of Stock"},{"type":"html","id":"ggK4vxH3Ue3_unavailableLabel","label":"ggK4vxH3Ue3_unavailableLabel","default":"Unavailable"},{"type":"html","id":"ggK4vxH3Ue3_variantSelectionRequiredMessage","label":"ggK4vxH3Ue3_variantSelectionRequiredMessage","default":"Please select a variant to add product to cart"},{"type":"html","id":"ggK4vxH3Ue3_successMessage","label":"ggK4vxH3Ue3_successMessage","default":"Add product to cart successfully"},{"type":"html","id":"ggK4vxH3Ue3_errorMessage","label":"ggK4vxH3Ue3_errorMessage","default":"Cannot add product to cart"},{"type":"html","id":"ggGxJARUIfX_text","label":"ggGxJARUIfX_text","default":"<p>The greatest Christmas memories are often created when everyone puts down their phones, gathers around the same table, and simply enjoys being together. A personalized Memobrick gives families another reason to slow down, work together, laugh, and remember the moments that matter most.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>This Christmas, give more than something that can be unwrapped. Give your loved ones a memory they can build together, a keepsake they can display, and an experience they will remember long after the holiday season is over.</p>"}],
